{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2022b.q13.material.recovered", "text": "材料：春天来了，老师们都忙着为班级布置春天墙饰。张老师设计了一幅美丽的春天图画（图1），李老师只在墙上画了株大树的树干（图2），她希望幼儿能随时将看到的信息用剪纸、绘画等方式反映到墙面上。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1084, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1178, "next_source_question_number": 15, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 13, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022b.q13"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001", "ntce.outline.102.r019", "ntce.outline.102.r027"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022b.q13"], "word_count": 94, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1084, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1178, "next_source_question_number": 15, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 13, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33"}], "type": "真题", "copyri