{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2022b.q14.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面材料，进行活动设计。老师发现，大班的孩子们在玩买卖的游戏时，不管物品的价格多少总是随意的付款和收款比如：3元钱的东西，孩子们总是会拿1元，5元，10元的代钱币付钱；有的幼儿不计算总和，不管多少钱都随意给钱，收款的幼儿也随意收下。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1245, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1363, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022b.q14"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m5.k01", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m6.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.design", "ntce.youer.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001", "ntce.outline.102.r006", "ntce.outline.102.r007"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2022b.q14"], "word_count": 118, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "44e4f269a420af4340c4a2393354f72bc90c9303d478e9521a4c4caae3226e33", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1245, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1363, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256":